cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software release and the article below."
type: software
title: "positional-layers: code for 'Common cis-regulatory inputs shape local gene co-expression across human tissues'"
version: 1.3.3
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Danpc11/positional-layers"
url: "https://danpc11.github.io/positional-layers"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the decomposition of positional expression signals into a tissue mean profile,
  GC-associated variation, copy-number dosage and residual local covariance, together with the analysis scripts that
  produce every result, table and figure of the article, and an interactive simulator.
keywords:
  - gene co-expression
  - cis-regulation
  - chromatin architecture
  - eQTL
  - GTEx
  - Hi-C
  - RNA-seq GC bias
